sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 鼠标
    participant W as DDrawWidget
    participant D as 你的 _draw()

    U->>W: 按下 <Button-1>
    W->>W: button1 = True
    W->>D: _draw()
    U->>W: 松开 <ButtonRelease-1>
    W->>W: button1 = False
    W->>D: _draw()
    alt 鼠标仍在控件内
        W->>W: 生成 <<Clicked>>
    end
    Note over U,W: <Enter> / <Leave> 同理：更新 enter 后重绘一次
